    "title": "Pedestrian Found Dead on Katy Freeway Service Road Near Wirt Road - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elliott Greene ,\n5 hours ago A pedestrian was found dead early Thursday morning along the Katy Freeway service road at Wirt Road, prompting a Houston police investigation that was still underway as the morning commute got underway. Officers were called to the scene at about 5:45 a.m. after reports of a person lying in the road. Read full article\n1",
